    <item>
      <title>Room-temperature continuous-wave lasing-like emission from solution-processed bulk monolayer MoS&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt; thin films</title>
      <link>https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-79012-8</link>
      <content:encoded>
                &lt;p&gt;Nature Communications, Published online: 13 November 2026; &lt;a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-79012-8"&gt;doi:10.1038/s41467-026-79012-8&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Scaling up atomically thin light emitters remains challenging. Here, authors develop solution-processable bulk-monolayer MoS2 films that preserve monolayer optical properties and exhibit room-temperature lasing-like emission under continuous optical pumping at just a few nW.</content:encoded>
      <dc:title>Room-temperature continuous-wave lasing-like emission from solution-processed bulk monolayer MoS&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt; thin films</dc:title>
