      <title>Signatures of a Kondo insulator in a multilayer moiré Superlattice</title>
      <link>https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-78687-3</link>
      <content:encoded>
                &lt;p&gt;Nature Communications, Published online: 13 November 2026; &lt;a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-78687-3"&gt;doi:10.1038/s41467-026-78687-3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Kondo insulator phases are traditionally found in materials with f-electrons. Here, the authors present evidence towards the realization of a tunable Kondo insulator in a monolayer WS2/bilayer WSe2 moiré superlattice.</content:encoded>
