      <title>Scaling medical imaging report generation with multimodal reinforcement learning</title>
      <link>https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-78767-4</link>
      <content:encoded>
                &lt;p&gt;Nature Communications, Published online: 12 November 2026; &lt;a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-78767-4"&gt;doi:10.1038/s41467-026-78767-4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Researchers developed UniRG, a reinforcement learning framework that optimizes clinically aligned composite rewards for medical imaging report generation. UniRG outperforms prior models and demonstrates strong generalization across unseen hospitals and datasets</content:encoded>
