      <title>A single NLS directs AGO1 import shaping small RNA loading and silencing outputs in Arabidopsis</title>
      <link>https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-79175-4</link>
      <content:encoded>
                &lt;p&gt;Nature Communications, Published online: 12 November 2026; &lt;a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-79175-4"&gt;doi:10.1038/s41467-026-79175-4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Small RNAs guide ARGONAUTE proteins to their targets. Here the authors identify a pathway controlling AGO1 nuclear import and show that AGO1 subcellular localization shapes small RNA loading and silencing outputs in plants.</content:encoded>
